<div class="wrap prose">
  <h1>Support</h1>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ brand.supportEmail }}">{{ brand.supportEmail }}</a>. We usually reply within two business days.</p>
  <h2>To help us help you, please include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your browser and its version (for example, Chrome 154 on Windows 11).</li>
    <li>The address of the page you were saving, if it isn't private.</li>
    <li>What you expected and what happened instead.</li>
    <li>The diagnostic info from the extension: Options → Copy diagnostic info. It contains versions, settings and recent error messages — never your licence key or the pages you saved.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Licence key problems</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>"That key wasn't recognised":</strong> copy the whole key from your receipt email again; a missing character is the usual cause.</li>
    <li><strong>"This key has used all {{ brand.activationLimit }} activations":</strong> each browser counts as one. Press Deactivate (Options → Licence) in a browser you no longer use, or email us and we'll reset it.</li>
    <li><strong>A charge from "{{ brand.seller.storeName }}"?</strong> That's this purchase: {{ brand.seller.storeName }} is the store's name on Lemon Squeezy, which sells {{ brand.proName }}.</li>
    <li><strong>Lost your key?</strong> Lemon Squeezy can resend your receipt from its "My orders" page, or email us with your purchase email address.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>See the <a href="/legal/refunds/">refund policy</a>. Just email us — no questions asked within {{ brand.refundDays }} days.</p>
  <p>Many answers are in the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
</div>
